 "honest": [
  "the cuts are bar-count splits of one warm curve, not separate books: the simulation is run once per cost level, so no cut can differ by engine state",
  "a band is max(part spread) - min(part spread); the sweep shows how that range moves with the cut, it does not convert a band into a risk or an error bar",
  "widest_window names the window at that cut and can move when the cut moves, so a window quoted without its cut is not reproducible",
  "descriptive census only: no gate, no verdict, no prereg, no trial count"
 ],
